msgid "STEP Import"
msgstr "Importation STEP"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:288
msgid "Angular Deflection"
msgstr "Déflexion angulaire"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:293
msgid ""
"Maximum angle between the surface normal and the normal of a generated "
"triangle. Smaller values give a more precise but heavier mesh."
msgstr ""
"Angle maximal entre la normale à la surface et la normale d'un triangle "
"généré. Des valeurs plus petites donnent un maillage plus précis mais plus "
"lourd."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:297
#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:298
msgid "Linear Deflection"
msgstr "Déflexion linéaire"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:304
msgid ""
"Maximum distance between the exact surface and a generated triangle. Smaller "
"values give a more precise but heavier mesh."
msgstr ""
"Distance maximale entre la surface exacte et un triangle généré. Des valeurs "
"plus petites donnent un maillage plus précis mais plus lourd."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:308
msgid "Relative Deflection"
msgstr "Déflexion relative"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Treat the linear deflection as a fraction of the edge size instead of an "
"absolute distance."
msgstr ""
"Traite la déflexion linéaire comme une fraction de la taille de l'arête au "
"lieu d'une distance absolue."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:312
msgid "Auto Colorize"
msgstr "Colorisation automatique"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:314
msgid ""
"Assign distinct colors to the imported components. Has no effect if the STEP "
"file already contains colors."
msgstr ""
"Attribue des couleurs distinctes aux composants importés. N'a aucun effet si "
"le fichier STEP contient déjà des couleurs."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:316
msgid "Force Load Sub-Shapes"
msgstr "Forcer le chargement des sous-formes"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:318
msgid ""
"Always load the bodies (solids and shells) of a shape as separate child "
"objects, even if the shape has a single body."
msgstr ""
"Charge toujours les corps (solides et coques) d'une forme en tant qu'objets "
"enfants distincts, même si la forme ne comporte qu'un seul corps."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:327
msgid "Global"
msgstr "Global"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:329
