"Allow tool windows to be moved outside the main window. To apply the "
"changes, need to restart the application."
msgstr ""
"Permet de déplacer les fenêtres d'outils en dehors de la fenêtre principale. "
"Pour appliquer les modifications, il faut redémarrer l'application."

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:377
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Comportement"

#: source/MRCommonPlugins/ViewerButtons/MRViewerSettingsPlugin.cpp:385
